Adafruit Bluefruit (Bluetooth Dev Board)
A small programmable board that adds Bluetooth to your DIY electronics.
Bluetooth Low Energy development platform for IoT projects.
Used to build and test BLE communication systems.
Helps researchers learn Bluetooth security and protocol behavior.
⚠️ Should not be used for unauthorized device access.

ESP32 Camera (Security / IoT Device)
Microcontroller with built-in WiFi/Bluetooth and camera support.
Used for IoT automation, monitoring, and computer-vision projects.
Popular in security research and embedded system learning.
⚠️ Using cameras to spy without consent is illegal.
